flowchart TD
    CLI[clinical-trial-agent run] --> CSG[compile_supervisor_graph]
    CSG --> SUP[SupervisorOrchestrator]
    SUP --> PIPE[run_tools_pipeline]
    PIPE --> RET[compiled_retrieval_graph]
    PIPE --> ELI[compiled_eligibility_graph]
    PIPE --> SYN[compiled_synthesis_graph]

    RET --> CT[ClinicalTrials.gov API]
    ELI --> LLM[DeepSeek / configured LLM]
    SYN --> REPORT[report_json + report_text]

    SUP --> MEM[(PostgreSQL memory/cache)]
    SUP --> CHK[(LangGraph checkpointer)]

    LGDEV[LangGraph dev server] -. dev/testing only .-> E2E[langgraph_app end_to_end_graph]
    E2E -. inspection .-> DEVRET[COMPILED_RETRIEVAL]
    E2E -. inspection .-> DEVELI[COMPILED_ELIGIBILITY]
    E2E -. inspection .-> DEVSYN[COMPILED_SYNTHESIS]
